        "TileImage": "$($repository 4601f70d-be0e-461b-8b54-2e2ac483b72f).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47,\r\rYour target is Lena Bjoernshauge, the newly appointed CEO of Kronstadt Industries. Following the events in Miami, Providence wanted to ensure that they could retain their influence over the company by installing one of their own associates as CEO. They did this by sabotaging the vehicle of the rightfully appointed CEO triggering a fatal &quot;accident&quot;. You are tasked with eliminating Lena in order to show Providence who really has the hidden hand.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
